00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:03.296 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Virgin Galactic vise 2022

00:01:01.128 --> 00:01:04.498 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour le début de ses vols

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:05.732 size:53% position:73% line:53%
